  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Technical Expert in the Central African Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the Central African Republic (CAR), a new internal conflict began at the end of 2012, adding to the chronic instability brought on by thirty years of military and political crises. It has been marked by serious acts of violence, killings, particularly of civilians, looting and grave human rights violations. All these aspects explain the need for a mental health and psychosocial support response. There are urgent immediate needs around MHPSS that should be addressed. The overall aim is to integrate MHPSS within the local humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
